---
// vuldesk.com — one-page plain-English site ("set letter" direction).
// Copy and layout source of record: docs/designs/assets/one-page-wireframe-v3.html
// Plan of record: docs/designs/plain-english-one-page-site.md
//
// Page structure (design doc, five blocks, one action):
//
//   HEADER  wordmark + "Email me"            (SiteHeader.astro, D3)
//   HERO    H1 offer → sub → evidence line → CTA + visible email
//   PROOF   single durability band           (D6 removed-element state:
//            the sample-report entry joins it when OQ4 resolves)
//   PRICES  ruled typographic table          (amounts = ship-floor item, OQ3)
//   TRUST   photo + five plain Q&As          (photo = ship-floor item, D7)
//   CLOSE   one question, one button
//
// Gates that police this file: scripts/check-integrity.mjs CHECK 5 (<=450
// visible words, zero jargon-inventory terms, incl. og/meta strings), CHECK 6
// (blog teardown), CHECK 7 (metadata present). Cold-read harness:
// docs/designs/assets/cold-read-harness.md (3/3 at >=7 on desktop AND mobile).
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_MAILTO, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '~/navigation';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Vuldesk — AI tools that read your records and give you answers',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="letter">
    <div class="measure">
      <h1>I build AI tools that read your records and give you answers.</h1>
      <p>
        Orders, cases, claims, forms &mdash; every business has a pile that someone reads
        by hand. I build a tool that reads yours and tells you what matters. You open it
        in your web browser. A price fixed before we start. No programmers needed on
        your side.
      </p>
      <p class="example">
        <strong>Real example:</strong> one of my tools read 118 foreclosure court cases
        and found the 57 that no longer mattered. 37 seconds per case.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href={CONTACT_MAILTO}>Tell me about your pile &rarr;</a>
        <span class="cta-alt">or write to {CONTACT_EMAIL}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF — single-band state (D6). When the sample report exists and passes
       the jargon gate (OQ4/D10), it returns as the primary entry beside this. -->
  <section class="letter ruled">
    <div class="measure">
      <h2>Proof you can check</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Still running after 20 months.</strong> I built a booking system for a
        fertility clinic in 2024. It runs today.<br />
        <a href="https://ivf.vuldesk.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See it live</a>
        <span class="cta-alt">(the clinic&rsquo;s real booking page opens in a new tab)</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICES — amounts are the founder's ship-floor item (OQ3). -->
  <section class="letter ruled">
    <div class="measure">
      <h2>What it costs</h2>
      <table class="prices">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>One small tool</strong><br />Reads one kind of record. Ready in weeks.</td>
            <td class="amount">$7,500</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <strong>A bigger tool</strong><br />Reads several kinds of records and does
              more with them. Fixed quote before we start.
            </td>
            <td class="amount">from $15,000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <strong>Keep it healthy</strong> (optional)<br />I watch it and fix it. I
              reply within one business day.
            </td>
            <td class="amount">$500 / month</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="after-table">The price I quote is the price you pay. No hourly billing. No surprises.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST -->
  <section class="letter ruled">
    <div class="measure">
      <h2>Questions a careful buyer asks</h2>
      <div class="founder">
        <!-- SHIP-FLOOR ITEM (D7): replace with a real photograph before push.
             Brief: head and shoulders, plain light background, source >=640px,
             <img src=... alt="Himal, founder of Vuldesk" width="112" height="112"> -->
        <div class="photo" aria-hidden="true">[PHOTO]</div>
        <p>I am Himal. I run Vuldesk from Kathmandu, and I build every tool myself.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <p>Who owns the tool?</p>
        <p>You do. When you pay the final bill, the tool and its accounts move to your name.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <p>What if you disappear?</p>
        <p>
          You lose nothing. The tool keeps running as it is, and the code and the
          accounts are already yours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <p>What happens to my data?</p>
        <p>
          Your records go into your tool and the AI service it runs on &mdash; under your
          account, not mine. I never use them for anything else.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <p>What happens when the tool is wrong?</p>
        <p>
          The tool marks what it is not sure about, and a person checks those. Nothing
          happens automatically that you cannot undo.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <p>How do we talk?</p>
        <p>Email, plus one call a week if you want it. I overlap with US business hours every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CLOSE -->
  <section class="letter ruled">
    <div class="measure">
      <h2>Have a pile of records that eats your team&rsquo;s time?</h2>
      <p>
        Tell me about it in plain words. I will reply within one business day, with a
        price &mdash; or the questions I need answered first.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href={CONTACT_MAILTO}>Email me</a>
        <span class="cta-alt">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Set-letter system (DESIGN.md). Tokens from CustomStyles.astro. */
  .letter {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--aw-font-sans), sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.0625rem; /* 17px */
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 56px 0;
  }
  .measure {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .ruled .measure {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 56px;
  }
  .ruled {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  h1,
  h2,
  .amount {
    font-family: var(--aw-font-heading), serif;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.125rem; /* 34px */
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem; /* 22px */
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .example {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 14px;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .btn {
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px; /* touch target (D15) */
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 10px 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .cta-alt {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  a:visited:not(.btn) {
    color: #5b3a29;
  }
  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .prices {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .prices td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 12px 16px 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .prices .amount {
    font-size: 1.3125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .after-table {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .founder {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .photo {
    width: 112px;
    height: 112px;
    flex: 0 0 112px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .qa {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 14px 0;
  }
  .qa p:first-child {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* One quiet entrance (design review D12): hero children fade/rise once. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .letter:first-of-type .measure > * {
      animation: rise 0.2s ease-out both;
    }
    .letter:first-of-type .measure > *:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 60ms;
    }
    .letter:first-of-type .measure > *:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 120ms;
    }
    .letter:first-of-type .measure > *:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: 180ms;
    }
    @keyframes rise {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(6px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem; /* 28px (D14) */
    }
    .letter {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .ruled .measure {
      padding-top: 40px;
    }
    .measure {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }
    .founder {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
